<Plain title="ytk" description="ytk: a private tool that uploads and manages videos on its owner's own YouTube channels.">
  <h1>ytk</h1>
  <p>ytk is a private command-line tool that Khanh Nguyen uses to run his own YouTube channels. It runs on his own computer and is not offered to anyone else.</p>
  <p>With the owner's permission, granted through Google sign-in, it:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>uploads finished videos to the owner's channels as private videos and sets their titles, descriptions, thumbnails and playlists;</li>
    <li>reads the channels' YouTube Analytics numbers (views, watch time, retention) to compare videos;</li>
    <li>copies finished videos into a folder in the owner's Google Drive.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/ytk/privacy/">Privacy policy</a> · Contact: <a href="mailto:khanhng93@proton.me">khanhng93@proton.me</a></p>
</Plain>
